    bool ConfirmDiscard(){if(!dirty)return true;DialogResult r=MessageBox.Show(this,"Save changes to this drawing?","IDeaSKETCHER",MessageBoxButtons.YesNoCancel,MessageBoxIcon.Question);if(r==DialogResult.Cancel)return false;return r!=DialogResult.Yes||Save(false);}
    void NewDocument(){if(!ConfirmDiscard())return;using(Setup s=new Setup{Owner=this})if(s.ShowDialog(this)==DialogResult.OK)SetDocument(new Document(s.Preset),null);}
    void Open(){if(!ConfirmDiscard())return;using(OpenFileDialog f=new OpenFileDialog{Filter="IDeaSKETCHER project (*.idsk)|*.idsk"})if(f.ShowDialog(this)==DialogResult.OK)try{Document d=Document.Load(f.FileName);SetDocument(d,f.FileName);}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);}}
    bool Save(bool asNew){if(canvas.Doc==null)return false;string path=projectPath;if(path==null||asNew)using(SaveFileDialog f=new SaveFileDialog{Filter="IDeaSKETCHER project (*.idsk)|*.idsk",DefaultExt="idsk",FileName=path==null?"Untitled.idsk":Path.GetFileName(path)}){if(f.ShowDialog(this)!=DialogResult.OK)return false;path=f.FileName;}try{canvas.Doc.Save(path);projectPath=path;dirty=false;UpdateStatus();return true;}catch(Exception ex){Error(ex);return false;}}
