tructive undo/redo, duplicate, project persistence and export");results.Add("PASS: arc fitting/endpoints, pixel arc undo, freehand vector simplification and Ctrl/Alt/Shift modifiers");results.Add("PASS: vector box selection, Shift/Ctrl path selection, group scale/delete/undo, rectangle/square, all-shape point editing and edited ellipse save/reopen");results.Add("PASS: S/R pixel and vector transforms, preview/cancel, single undo, selection outline restoration");results.Add("PASS: HSV entry/channels, neutral colours and grey brightness, top selection buttons, vector icons/buttons, exactly-two-point midpoint insertion and undo");results.Add("PASS: open ellipse arcs, selection union/subtraction/holes, lasso jitter smoothing, F full-layer/selection fill, airbrush buildup, polyline geometry and persistence");results.Add("PASS: Ctrl ellipse fit accuracy, rotated/circular loops, incomplete gesture rejection, continuous outline, undo and eraser selection clipping");results.Add("PASS: slider-only controls, smoothing toggle/recall, selection drawing/erasing/deletion undo, curve point shortcuts and fractional stroke save/reopen");results.Add("PASS: curvature/free-polygon selection and every draft repaint at 0/50/100 taper, repeated clicks, completion and cancellation");results.Add("PASS: predictive cleanup, tablet pressure, French curve drawing/erasing, taper hit testing, undo and save/reopen");results.Add("PASS: guide recall, curvature spline creation/editing, vector rotation drag, axis ellipse resize, new brush limits, spline/rotation save and reopen");results.Add("PASS: visible Windows vector cursor, arrow picker, polygon sides, live weight, geometry-only undo, partial redraw equality");results.Add("PASS: separate pixel/vector layers, context-sensitive controls, file migration, draggable rotation grip, Shift-drag preview cancellation");results.Add("PASS: Shift lines, rotated guide drawing/editing, Tab/Esc, typed colours, vector creation/edit/undo/save, independent layer duplication");results.Add("PASS: UI tools/layers/undo/colours/zoom, sliders, light/dark themes, pressure dropdown, cursor selection, guides, maximized startup, brush popup and colour-wheel-to-stroke regression tests");
